(433, 179, '接口成员省略 public、static、final、abstract 的等价写法', 'public interface Computable{        等价  public interface Computable{\n   int MAX = 1000;                         public static final int MAX = 1000;\n   void add(Computable obj);               public abstract void add(Computable obj);\n   void substract(Computable obj);         public abstract void substract(Computable obj);\n}                                          }', 0, 326, 62),
