(454, 184, '密封接口 Eatable 及其子类、子接口的修饰符示例', 'sealed interface Eatable\n    permits Fruit, Vegetable, egg, Cooked { … }\nabstract sealed class Fruit implements Eatable\n    permits Apple, Orange { … }\nfinal class Apple extends Fruit { … }\nfinal class Orange extends Fruit { … }\nabstract non-sealed class Vegetable implements Eatable {…}\nfinal class egg implements Eatable { … }\nnon-sealed interface Cooked extends Eatable { … }', 0, 332, 83),
